warpfone, the iOS client of Warpnet

This directory contains a modified copy of Ice Cubes, a SwiftUI Mastodon client
by Thomas Ricouard and contributors: https://github.com/Dimillian/IceCubesApp

Upstream revision: 95420025342e599ac511a26b87febcbcacff57a0 (2024-02-06,
version 1.10.31). This is the last revision published under the Apache License,
Version 2.0. Ice Cubes moved to AGPL-3.0 on 2024-02-10 in 7b7e65bf, and nothing
from that revision or later is included here.

The files taken from Ice Cubes remain under the Apache License, Version 2.0
(see LICENSE in this directory).

Changes made by the Warpnet project are listed below. Every Swift and xcconfig
file that Warpnet changed starts with the line "// Modified by Warpnet. See
NOTICE." Project, property list, entitlements and string catalog files cannot
carry that line, so they are named here instead.

